From d9154a87b7197f88c9e77886fa6802bafb7e53af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Forsch <alexander.forsch@bytesatwork.ch>
Date: Mon, 26 Aug 2024 18:16:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arch:arm64:config: add defconfig for byteDEVKIT3
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add support for byteDEVKIT3, config.

Signed-off-by: Alexander Forsch <alexander.forsch@bytesatwork.ch>
Signed-off-by: Stephan Dünner <stephan.duenner@bytesatwork.ch>
---
 .../arm64/configs/bytedevkit_imx8mp_defconfig | 35 ++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/bytedevkit_imx8mp_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/bytedevkit_imx8mp_defconfig
index 04e06172379a..3991c029566e 100644
